{"id":16963,"date":"2026-04-07T14:53:11","date_gmt":"2026-04-07T14:53:11","guid":{"rendered":""},"modified":"2026-04-07T14:53:11","modified_gmt":"2026-04-07T14:53:11","slug":"joy-elle-mysticmag","status":"publish","type":"psychic","link":"http:\/\/psychic-review-directorycom.local\/psychics\/joy-elle-mysticmag\/","title":{"rendered":"Joy Elle"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Joy EllefromHealing Visionshas a profound journey in the realms of healing and spirituality. Her journey into the spiritual arts began at a young age when she started counseling friends and offering guidance. Joy is a certified Reiki master, chakra balancer, and crystal healer, and she possesses a unique ability to communicate with spirits and energies from the other side. Her experiences and mentorship have led her to help others on their spiritual journeys, guiding them to release the past, embrace their soul plans, and find fulfillment and joy in their lives and relationships. Joy\u2019s ultimate goal is to bring enlightenment, peace, and comfort to others through her unique spiritual counseling and healing abilities.MysticMaghas the pleasure. In elementary school, kids would come to me with their problems. I found myself giving them advice. They asked me how I knew what would happen to them after events would occur. I said that I didn\u2019t know how I knew. At the time, I didn\u2019t know the Holy Spirit was allowing me to prophesize to them.I felt comfortable listening to others and giving advice from a young age. I felt if others would take my advice they would live their dream life. However, most people I have discovered will ask you a question and still do what they want to do. Then, they call back to say they should have listened. I explain that their soul was yearning for the experience and lessons from that circumstance so they were pulled to go in that direction, even though their angels were giving them guidance for the least challenging path. Your angels will always give you the best direction. It\u2019s our free will how we choose to get to the end result. I was having dinner with a co-worker years ago. I was aware of the fact that my friend\u2019s husband, who had been deceased for the last year, was standing beside me. I had been seeing my friend\u2019s husband for a few months since his crossing over to the other side. I was like a daughter to these friends and he was always worrying about me. My co-worker, whom I did not know was spiritual, until that point in time said, \u201cJoy, I know you are aware of the man standing next to you smiling. Do not be afraid, I see him too.\u201d With that, I finally was able to share my experiences with someone. It turned out that my co-worker was an American Indian, a very wise spiritual man, who could see energy from other dimensions. He explained to me that it is like a ceiling fan. When the blades are still, you can see them clearly. When the blades are spinning fast, they disappear through the energy. Our loved one\u2019s that cross over are still here with us. Their soul is just vibrating on another dimension of energy. We are still able to communicate with them. When they communicate with us an Angel helps them to be seen and heard by bringing them into this vibration. This energy on Earth is very thick, so it takes a lot of energy for light beings from heaven to communicate with us where we are aware of their presence here. It\u2019s like going under water and holding your breath. You can only hold it for so long until you have to come up for air. This is how it is for spirits on the other side when they visit us here. They are always communicating with us through telepathy. It\u2019s how we communicate here and there. To see them and hear them means they just took a challenging journey to visit you. Your soul really needed this to understand their message and love for you. I learned that love is eternal and your loved ones never leave you. We each have a soul group and we stay within our soul group throughout each life changing relationship types.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Joy EllefromHealing Visionshas a profound journey in the realms of healing and spirituality. Her journey into the spiritual arts began at a young age when she started counseling friends and offering guidance. Joy is a certified Reiki master, chakra b&#8230;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_rating":0,"_total_ratings":0,"_total_readings":0,"_price_per_minute":0,"_intro_offer":"","_availability":"unknown","_source_sites":"[\"mysticmag.com\"]","_source_urls":"[\"https:\/\/www.mysticmag.com\/psychic-reading\/gifts-of-spirituality-and-healing-with-joy-elle\/\"]","_languages":"[]","_tools_used":"[]","_communication_style":"","_years_experience":0,"_member_since":"","_reviews_json":"[]","_photo_urls":"[\"https:\/\/www.mysticmag.com\/wp-content\/themes\/comparison\/assets\/img\/quiz-loader.gif\"]"},"psychic_specialty":[],"psychic_skill":[],"class_list":["post-16963","psychic","type-psychic","status-publish","hentry"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v27.2 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\r\n<title>Joy Elle - Psychic Review Directory<\/title>\r\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\r\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"http:\/\/psychic-review-directorycom.local\/psychics\/joy-elle-mysticmag\/\" \/>\r\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\r\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\r\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Joy Elle - Psychic Review Directory\" \/>\r\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Joy EllefromHealing Visionshas a profound journey in the realms of healing and spirituality. Her journey into the spiritual arts began at a young age when she started counseling friends and offering guidance. Joy is a certified R